{"id":"6477de4a04201a72","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Equivalence Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category — ZFC Cat2 Equivalence Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category — ZFC Cat2 Equivalence Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-equivalence-category — ZFC Cat2 Equivalence Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c166bd3b5abb270\" href=\"?note=6c166bd3b5abb270\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77af8d422f1b33a0\" href=\"?note=77af8d422f1b33a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ea8fe70b7dab958\" href=\"?note=4ea8fe70b7dab958\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S\\)</span> (full-functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c166bd3b5abb270\" href=\"?note=6c166bd3b5abb270\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S\\)</span> (faithful-functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"77af8d422f1b33a0\" href=\"?note=77af8d422f1b33a0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}\">\\(\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}\\)</span> (essential-surjectivity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ea8fe70b7dab958\" href=\"?note=4ea8fe70b7dab958\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor\">58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An equivalence functor is full, faithful, and essentially surjective.</li>\n<li>The former dependency on <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1a891abf5fe2909c\" href=\"?note=1a891abf5fe2909c\" title=\"58-df-equivalence\">58-df-equivalence</a> was a type error: that atom defines equivalence relations, not equivalences of categories.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor","status":"resolved","id":"6c166bd3b5abb270","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"77af8d422f1b33a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor","status":"resolved","id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor","status":"resolved","id":"6c166bd3b5abb270","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S$ (full-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-full-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"77af8d422f1b33a0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S$ (faithful-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor","status":"resolved","id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}$ (essential-surjectivity predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-essentially-surjective-functor]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"1a891abf5fe2909c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The former dependency on [[58-df-equivalence]] was a type error: that atom defines equivalence relations, not equivalences of categories.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}category} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCat2EquivalenceCategory}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCat2FullFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{EssentiallySurjective}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":true}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"29db814da2b21ab4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"78c3be29a4eab0f7","ancho